default hints are mistakes: true
c3 selected: selected c3, targets 0, wrong - flash -1.0 at 1.0, pulsing 0
tap c5: selected c3, targets 0, wrong c5 flash 34.0 at 0.25, pulsing 0
animating at 1.2 s: true, at 1.4 s: false, the frame that ends it is drawn: true
after the flash: selected c3, targets 0, wrong - flash -1.0 at 1.0, pulsing 0
tap b6: selected -, targets 0, wrong - flash -1.0 at 1.0, pulsing 0
drop e3 on e5: selected e3, targets 0, wrong e5 flash 36.0 at 0.0, pulsing 0
d4 to c5 with a capture due: selected d4, targets 0, wrong c5 flash 34.0 at 0.083333336, pulsing 2
touch a3: selected -, targets 0, wrong a3 flash 16.0 at 0.0, pulsing 1
hints on moves, d4 selected: selected d4, targets 1, wrong - flash -1.0 at 1.0, pulsing 1
